editor_description = "Rotate THIS marker to fix how the pick alone sits in the hand -- it only affects this weapon, not other equipped items.
Unit.gd's _align_to_grip_point maps this marker's own local axes 1:1 onto the character's GripOffset axes. This is the lower/power-hand grip, positioned at the lower leather-wrap band on the handle (local Y=0.25, measured off the model's own AABB -- handle runs from the butt at Y=0 to the head at Y~1.0). Reused the same rotation as GreatswordBase's own GripPoint since both are a long implement held along its own local +Y shaft with the head/blade at the far end -- if the pick looks wrong in-hand the same way every gripped weapon would, fix ParentUnit.tscn's GripOffset instead of here."

